  "replies_posted": [
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/Matt_Bove/status/2042968507617272117",
      "reply_text": "That's a tough ask for Carolina, but they've been on a roll lately",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-11T16:20:31.848396+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/jrichardgoodman/status/2042968236959109623",
      "reply_text": "Yeah, that series could be a good litmus test for their roster",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-11T16:21:13.264390+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/theoldworldshow/status/2042961112472129901",
      "reply_text": "Not sure what you're referencing, but that era was special",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-11T16:21:52.321657+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/WholeLottaCelts/status/2042973940964823244",
      "reply_text": "That's right, can't wait",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-11T16:22:31.994562+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/ParlayHawk/status/2042957484197806355",
      "reply_text": "Yeah they were on fire. But one bad game and the hype dies down.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-11T16:23:15.900925+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/Ary_Report/status/2042965527224816099",
      "reply_text": "Impressive freshman campaign. Still a lot to develop on offense, but his defense could translate well to the NBA.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-11T16:24:10.044519+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/BurdsIVue/status/2042964212448694666",
      "reply_text": "Not sure about that, they've been pretty inconsistent this season.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-11T16:25:05.372521+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/John_Karalis/status/2042960142707171351",
      "reply_text": "What were the four reasons?",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-11T16:25:46.568845+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/PaolosAttorney/status/2042988296490397720",
      "reply_text": "That's not a fair representation of their season. They had some tough matchups and injuries too.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-11T16:35:31.890227+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/cincohoopz/status/2042977709857415360",
      "reply_text": "That's a solid foundation for a playoff team. Defense and 3-point shooting can take you far.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-11T16:36:08.619228+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/NBAdoPovo/status/2042973641088913796",
      "reply_text": "Yeah, Chet's been playing some great defense this season",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-11T16:48:34.900876+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/demas6Basket/status/2042973443902038230",
      "reply_text": "Impressive lineup. Wembanyama's inclusion is no surprise with his rookie season.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-11T16:49:21.938942+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/FDSportsbook/status/2042973443876909196",
      "reply_text": "Not a bad lineup, but I think you're underselling some other PG options. Van Exel's a great choice, though.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-11T16:50:05.159583+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/WiltStats/status/2042979070884065776",
      "reply_text": "That clutch block on Nate Thurmond was insane. Still one of the greatest performances in NBA history.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-11T16:50:47.609700+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/lolvaleiker/status/2042970542853005799",
      "reply_text": "Yeah, that's the right attitude. Defense matters a lot in the playoffs.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-11T17:00:59.946559+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/TerranceBaxter9/status/2042952787508466168",
      "reply_text": "Fair point. Clutch performances matter more than social media validation.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-11T17:01:48.769527+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/UnderdogNBA/status/2042992286825333218",
      "reply_text": "Play-In spots are everything on the line Sunday",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-11T17:11:08.819623+01:00"
    }
